forti-cli (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Packaging
    - Initial release of forti-cli: /usr/bin/forti and its man page, built
      against the system libforti-api-dev (>= 1.0.1); the forti-api wrap is
      never used in package builds (--wrap-mode=nodownload).
    - Release build profile: -O3 in place of dpkg's -O2, NDEBUG, and section
      garbage collection (-ffunction-sections -fdata-sections, --gc-sections);
      the network-free unit suite runs against that build unless nocheck.
    - amd64 only (vl-release supports one architecture per package contract).

 -- Cooper Larson <cooper@valkyrianlabs.com>  Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:29:02 +0000
